thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"All new england 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The All New England Opens at the Cape Cod Art Center</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T16:18:08-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 4:18 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Cape Cod Art Center, Barnstable Mass announced acceptance of artists in their Annual Juried Show, “The All New England” Guild members whose work will be exhibited: Anne Briggs, Larry <a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3651 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3651\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"373\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a woman wearing a black and white hat.\" src=\"/media/archive/17ba029536948e62bf6a0907464342d5f36869dc57b5336b7278ea8365129815.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" rel=\"bookmark\">ArtWeek Demonstrator, Doris Mee</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-29T19:21:45-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, March 29, 2018, 7:21 pm\">March 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists, as part of the upcoming ArtWeek festival happening April 27 – May 6, presents a Meet the Artist demonstration featuring master <a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3631 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3631\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Season Kicks Off Early for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-25T13:32:43-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, March 25, 2018, 1:32 pm\">March 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Special for ArtWeek, two demonstrations will kick off  the 2018 season at The Gallery of Harwich Artists. Larry Folding will demonstrate a Cape Cod painting in watercolor on April 28 <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3322 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-doris-mee tag-ellen-cuddy tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3322\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/last-saturday-in-august-proved-busy-for-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Doris Mee demonstrating her technique of mixed media and collage ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" src=\"/media/archive/6b5932dd76f9d7ab3891a3ddcce08c2668d45716f66d31c24cfec64ef4c70aff.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/last-saturday-in-august-proved-busy-for-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Last Saturday in August proved busy for Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-08-27T17:42:03-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, August 27, 2017, 5:42 pm\">August 27, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Ellen Cuddy and Doris Mee held a free demonstration on Saturday, August 26 from 2 to 4 pm at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists. The Art <a href=\"/news/last-saturday-in-august-proved-busy-for-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a clas